{title: Aaj Se Teri}
{artist: Arijit Singh Padman Amit Trivedi}
{key: Em}

{c: Verse 1}
[Em] [G] [D] [A],        Aaj se teri saari galiyan meri ho gayi
[Em] [G] [D] [A],        Aaj se mera ghar tera ho gaya
[Em] [G] [D] [A],        Aaj se meri saari khushiya teri ho gayi
[Em] [G] [D] [A],        Aaj se tera gham mera ho gaya
[Em] [G],        O tere kaandhe ka jo til hai
[D] [A],        O tere seene mein jo dil hai
[Em] [G],        O teri bijli ka jo bill hai
[D] [A],        Aaj se mera ho gaya
[Em] [G],        O mere khwabon ka ambar
[D] [A],        O meri khushiyon ka samandar
[Em] [G],        O mere pin code ka number
[D] [A],        Aaj se tera ho gaya
[Em],        Tere maathe?
[Em],        Tere maathe ke kumkum ko
[Em],        Main tilak laga ke ghoomuga
[A],        Teri baali ki chhun chhun ko
[D] [Em],        Main dil se laga ke jhoomunga
[Em],        Meri choti si bhulon
[Em],        Ko tu nadiya mein baha dena
[A],        Tere joode ke phoolon ko
[D] [Em],        Main apni shirt mein pehnunga
[G],        Bas mere liye tu maalpuve
[A],        Kabhi kabhi bana dena
[Em] [G] [D] [A],        Aaj se meri saari ratiyan teri ho gayi
[Em] [G] [D] [A],        Aaj se tera din mera ho gaya
[Em],        Tu maange sardi mein amiya
[Em],        Jo maange garmi mein mungfaliya
[A],        Tu barish mein agar kehde
[D] [Em],        Ja mere liye tu dhoop khila
[Em],        Toh main sooraj?
[Em],        Toh main sooraj ko jhatak dunga
[Em],        Toh main saawan ko gatak lunga
[A],        To saare taaron sang chanda
[D] [Em],        Main teri god mein rakh dunga
[G],        Bas mere liye tu kabhi
[A],        Khill ke muskura dena
[Em] [G] [D] [A],        Aaj se meri saari sadiyan teri ho gayi
[Em] [G] [D] [A],        Aaj se tera pal mera ho gaya
